  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "────あさひ\r\n……『つまらない』って言うかと思ったけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6017003090020,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "え？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601700309/6017003090020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、いや──俺はあさひのステージ、\r\n予選前よりずっといいものになったと思う",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6017003090030,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601700309/6017003090030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "何より、あさひのファンのみんなが\r\nそう感じてくれてるんじゃないかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6017003090040,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "でも、勝てなかったっすよ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0220",
    "voice": "produce_events/601700309/6017003090040"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0116",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "勝つとか負けるとかの前に、\r\nいいステージを見せてくれたら嬉しいんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今日はよかったぞ\r\nなんていうか……こっちを見てくれてる気がしたよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0220"
  },
  {
    "id": 6017003090050,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "ふーん……？\r\nそっすかね",
    "charAnim1": "think1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601700309/6017003090050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お客さんもそうだと思うし、少なくとも俺がそうだ\r\n────ありがとな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "言いすぎる時もあったけど\r\n俺の言葉に、ちゃんと耳を傾けてくれて",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6017003090060,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "そうなんすか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601700309/6017003090060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──えっ、違ってたら\r\nそれなりにショックなんだが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6017003090070,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "あははっ\r\nいっすよ、結構楽しかったっすから！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
